<title>JAPAN: NBC Industries -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>NBC Industries -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.92		vs	    4.68</p>
<p> Operating	  657    million	  vs	  653    million</p>
<p> Current	    653    million	  vs	  562    million</p>
<p> Net		  306    million	  vs	  280    million</p>
<p> EPS		   41.98 yen	  vs	   39.35 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - NBC Industries Co Ltd is a maker of mesh cloth for screen painting.</p>
